 **Data Structures:**
-*   **Vertex Configuration Index:** An integer formed by $2^n$ bits. For vertex $i$ (where $i \in [0, 2^n - 1]$), the $i$-th bit is set to 1 if $V_i > I$, and 0 otherwise.
